t m0 xa6 h7 ye8 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">中。</div><div class="t m0 x10 h10 yeb ff6 fs5 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.2.2<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff1">对半搜索</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h7 yec ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">对半搜索是一种二分搜索，设当前搜索的子表为<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffb">(<span class="_ _1a"></span><span class="ff8">𝑎</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x67 h16 yed ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑙<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑒<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑓<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑡<span class="_ _1a"></span>,<span class="_ _1a"></span>𝑎𝑙<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑒<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑓<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑡<span class="_ _1a"></span><span class="ffb">+<span class="ffe">1</span></span>,<span class="_ _d"></span>.<span class="_ _d"></span>.<span class="_ _d"></span>.<span class="_ _d"></span>,<span class="_ _1a"></span>𝑎</div><div class="t m0 xa7 h1b yee ff10 fs7 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑟<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑖<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑔<span class="_ _1a"></span>ℎ𝑡</div><div class="t m0 xa8 h7 yec ffb fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)<span class="_ _d"></span><span class="ff4">，令<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑚<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff9">=<span class="_ _8"> </span></span></span></span>(<span class="_ _d"></span><span class="ff8">𝑙<span class="_ _1a"></span>𝑒<span class="_ _f"> </span>𝑓<span class="_ _20"> </span>𝑡<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>+<span class="_ _f"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑟<span class="_ _1a"></span>𝑖<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑔<span class="_ _1a"></span>ℎ𝑡<span class="_ _1a"></span></span>)<span class="_ _d"></span>/<span class="ffe">2<span class="ff4">，这种二<span class="_ _d"></span>分</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x6 h7 yef ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">搜索被称为对半搜索。</div><div class="t m0 x10 h10 yf0 ff6 fs5 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.2.3<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff1">二叉判定树</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h7 yf1 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">二叉判定树模型：</div><div class="t m0 xa1 h7 yf2 ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws